{"id":"662518","name":"清汤萝卜排骨","author":"青梅果果儿","authorId":"11412049","desc":"","cover":"images/662518/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蔬菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜水去腥，泡十分钟。","img":"images/662518/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜切块。","img":"images/662518/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"排骨焯水。","img":"images/662518/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过温水洗净（别用冷水洗冷水会柴）。","img":"images/662518/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备调味。","img":"images/662518/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放排骨炒干水分，放至碗中调料，炒香。","img":"images/662518/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒至金黄放萝卜。","img":"images/662518/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"这样就可以加水啦。","img":"images/662518/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"换了一个高压锅，放点自己喜欢吃的玉米。","img":"images/662518/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加水没过排骨，炖十分钟（加的热水，加的热水）。","img":"images/662518/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"准备蒜苗。","img":"images/662518/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好嘞，出锅。","img":"images/662518/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"准备些小菜，吃火锅。","img":"images/662518/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"这个当然是不能少的啦。","img":"images/662518/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蘸水调好了。","img":"images/662518/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"饭后解腻小水果。","img":"images/662518/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}